msgstr "Nieg Sett..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, btGetNew)
#. +> trunk stable
#: emoticonslist.ui:123
msgid "Get new themes from the Internet"
msgstr "Nieg Setten ut dat Internet daalladen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btGetNew)
#. +> trunk stable
#: emoticonslist.ui:126
msgid "You need to be connected to the Internet to use this action. A dialog will display a list of emoticon themes from the http://www.kde.org website. Clicking the Install button associated with a theme will install this theme locally."
msgstr "Du muttst na't Internet tokoppelt wesen, wenn Du disse Funkschoon bruken wullt. En Dialoog wiest en List vun Setten, de dat op http://www.kde.org gifft. Klickst Du op en Sett sien Installeren-Knoop, warrt he lokaal installeert."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, btGetNew)
#. +> trunk stable
#: emoticonslist.ui:129
msgid "Get New Themes..."
msgstr "Nieg Setten halen..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, btInstall)
#. +> trunk stable
#: emoticonslist.ui:136
msgid "Install a theme archive file you already have locally"
msgstr "En Sett-Archievdatei installeren, de Du al op Dien Reekner hest"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btInstall)
#. +> trunk stable
#: emoticonslist.ui:139
msgid "If you already have an emoticon theme archive locally, this button will unpack it and make it available for KDE applications"
msgstr "Wenn Du al en Snutensett-Archiev op Dien Reekner hest, kannst Du dat mit dissen Knoop utpacken un för KDE-Programmen verföögbor maken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, btInstall)
#. +> trunk stable
#: emoticonslist.ui:142
msgid "Install Theme File..."
msgstr "Settdatei installeren..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, btRemoveTheme)
#. +> trunk stable
#: emoticonslist.ui:149
msgid "Remove the selected theme from your disk"
msgstr "Den utsöchten Sett vun Dien Fastplaat wegmaken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btRemoveTheme)
#. +> trunk stable
#: emoticonslist.ui:152
msgid "This will remove the selected theme from your disk."
msgstr "Disse Akschoon maakt den utsöchten Sett vun Dien Fastplaat weg."

